Subject: [PATCH 27/27] common: preserve upstream concurrency metric naming

Apply executable-prefix normalization to both total and base-capacity HTTP gauges after the upstream naming change. Preserve existing stock service names and admission behavior. Cover namespace normalization and recovered queue-item ownership for full and closed sends, including destruction outside the queue mutex.
---
 crates/common/src/codel_queue.rs | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 crates/common/src/http/mod.rs    | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

